WEBVTT

00:14.460 --> 00:17.290
The aura that flows through
everything in this world

00:17.290 --> 00:19.130
does not flow through dragons.

00:19.500 --> 00:21.830
Instead, magic power flows within them.

00:22.460 --> 00:25.790
It is a power from beyond
that alters our world.

00:25.790 --> 00:27.880
That is why silverine was born.

00:28.170 --> 00:33.540
The world created this power to
resist magic's transformative powers.

00:34.210 --> 00:35.540
Prey is drawing near.

00:35.540 --> 00:37.250
From behind, above, and before me.

00:37.250 --> 00:38.710
I draw them in.

00:38.710 --> 00:41.330
There's half a second until
the frontmost target's in reach.

00:41.710 --> 00:46.130
I use that time to refine
my silverine's freezing quality.

00:46.130 --> 00:48.210
It has a magical freezing power.

00:48.210 --> 00:52.460
If you aspire to slay all of dragonkind,

00:52.460 --> 00:54.500
you must master silverine!

00:56.130 --> 00:58.710
I only have to swing my sword one time.

00:58.710 --> 01:01.330
It's the silverine that cuts and kills prey.

01:01.750 --> 01:05.130
Silverine Battle Arts weren't the only thing
that made my future self powerful.

01:05.130 --> 01:09.460
It's also what I learned from my experiences:
the ability to get through a battle alive.

01:09.460 --> 01:12.830
Having an imagination is critical.

01:17.130 --> 01:20.080
The tip of the sword expels silverine.

01:20.080 --> 01:23.540
It freezes a dragon, then surges to the next.

01:23.540 --> 01:25.540
Every single shard of shattered dragons
and their trajectories

01:25.540 --> 01:27.750
must be visualized in the mind's eye.

01:28.420 --> 01:29.460
That's it.

01:29.460 --> 01:30.830
I remember.

01:30.830 --> 01:33.330
To me, the act of swinging a sword is

01:33.920 --> 01:36.630
conjuring the image of a dragonless future

01:39.670 --> 01:42.210
and actualizing that into reality!

02:09.540 --> 02:11.420
Even the meaning of life

02:11.420 --> 02:13.580
Was all taken away

02:13.580 --> 02:15.790
I was aiming to destroy

02:15.790 --> 02:18.580
This whole distorted world

02:18.580 --> 02:20.670
(In exchange for everything)

02:20.670 --> 02:22.830
I longed for power

02:22.830 --> 02:24.960
(Not caring about consequences)

02:24.960 --> 02:28.000
That waited at the end of the road

02:28.420 --> 02:32.460
Unleash yourself

02:32.460 --> 02:35.500
To change the future

02:35.500 --> 02:37.630
No one else will ever

02:37.630 --> 02:39.750
Have the answers

02:39.750 --> 02:41.580
So, I'm on my own

02:41.580 --> 02:43.880
To conquer my own path

02:44.170 --> 02:46.210
I've been fighting back

02:46.210 --> 02:48.460
In search of

02:48.460 --> 02:52.210
Not hope, not a miracle

02:52.210 --> 02:54.210
All I want is just the true meaning

02:54.210 --> 02:59.790
Of being with you

03:13.540 --> 03:18.960
<b>Episode 15: Latent Awakening</b>

03:16.380 --> 03:20.040
Once enemies get like that, they're tenacious.

03:20.580 --> 03:24.000
And then their fire spreads to
the people around them.

03:24.000 --> 03:26.630
That's true indeed,

03:26.630 --> 03:28.920
but no matter how long he holds on,

03:28.920 --> 03:32.000
the indispensable
Silverware Princess is already...

03:47.250 --> 03:48.170
Yo.

03:48.170 --> 03:50.170
You let your guard down, boss.

03:50.670 --> 03:53.460
The wounds on her head aren't bad,

03:53.460 --> 03:55.380
but her stomach wound is deep.

03:55.380 --> 03:56.790
Can you keep going?

03:58.080 --> 04:00.000
Let's go northwest!

04:01.210 --> 04:02.460
Got it.

04:04.170 --> 04:06.630
So, she's also still holding on.

04:06.630 --> 04:08.500
Also, one more thing.

04:08.500 --> 04:10.920
I sent Platinum Tiara to attack the base,

04:10.920 --> 04:13.080
but I can't telepathically
communicate with her.

04:13.330 --> 04:18.580
Five minutes ago, she reported she was
handily taking out the soldiers in the base.

04:18.580 --> 04:21.580
I haven't heard anything from
Ursh-Gaurun either.

04:21.580 --> 04:24.000
Were they defeated?

04:24.000 --> 04:26.790
Temruog's squad to M-11.

04:26.790 --> 04:29.460
Aerial squad, begin fire.

04:29.460 --> 04:32.080
Grym's squad to F-14.

04:32.420 --> 04:36.830
They defeated a Thirteenth Seat and
an elite mature dragon that quickly?

04:36.830 --> 04:39.710
They still have that much
fighting power in their base?

04:40.210 --> 04:43.210
They keep blowing my expectations
out of the water.

04:43.580 --> 04:45.210
Olto Zora.

04:45.210 --> 04:47.330
I know, I know!

04:47.330 --> 04:49.750
You were gonna tell me
not to have too much fun, right?

04:49.750 --> 04:52.580
I'll take this seriously!
I mean, I am taking this seriously!

04:52.920 --> 04:55.790
How much longer until the spell is recharged?

04:55.790 --> 04:57.630
Five minutes or so.

04:57.630 --> 05:01.080
Great! Then that's how long
the corps has to live.

05:02.540 --> 05:04.670
Let's pit those nuisances chasing us

05:04.670 --> 05:08.750
against the sweeties that just
crushed the aerial squad.

05:08.750 --> 05:11.830
When you're ready, just give me a holler.

05:12.500 --> 05:15.500
Comrade, do you truly grasp the situation?

05:16.330 --> 05:19.710
Normally, you don't need to
rely on my reports

05:19.710 --> 05:22.710
to form a complete picture
of the battlefield.

05:23.290 --> 05:27.500
It's all well and good
if you're simply being rash.

05:28.080 --> 05:30.460
But if that's not the case...

05:30.460 --> 05:34.630
What do the Silverware Princess
and her corps remind you of?

05:34.630 --> 05:35.920
No...

05:35.920 --> 05:40.000
But I might take out the princess
myself before then.

05:40.000 --> 05:41.540
Understood.

05:42.540 --> 05:44.460
There are no holes in the plan.

05:44.460 --> 05:47.210
My comrade is over the past now.

05:47.210 --> 05:49.630
There is only one thing I need to do.

05:49.960 --> 05:54.130
Five minutes from now,
blast everything to bits!

05:55.880 --> 05:57.380
I messed up and missed one!

05:57.380 --> 05:59.750
The way it shattered was
a fry cry from how I imagined.

05:59.750 --> 06:01.710
I need to adjust the way I attack.

06:07.830 --> 06:09.170
Why are you butting in?

06:09.170 --> 06:10.880
Butting in? What?

06:10.880 --> 06:12.710
I'm helping you!

06:12.710 --> 06:14.080
Helping...?

06:15.210 --> 06:16.790
He's changed.

06:16.790 --> 06:20.710
I thought his strength and
demeanor didn't match.

06:20.710 --> 06:22.290
But now...

06:22.710 --> 06:25.040
Oh, yeah. You're right.

06:27.170 --> 06:28.540
Shin Cutlass.

06:28.540 --> 06:30.670
You told me not to act like the hero.

06:30.670 --> 06:32.380
You were right about that too.

06:32.880 --> 06:37.040
I have no right to stop anyone
who desires to hunt dragons.

06:37.960 --> 06:39.960
I apologize. Sorry.

06:40.380 --> 06:41.790
I won't stop you again.

06:42.170 --> 06:45.880
The one apologizing shouldn't be so intense!

06:45.880 --> 06:47.500
Fight however you want.

06:47.500 --> 06:49.330
And I'll protect you however I want.

06:50.670 --> 06:52.790
Has nothing I've said to you
gotten through your thick skull?

06:52.790 --> 06:54.420
He'sh jusht that shtupid!

06:54.420 --> 06:55.670
Why do you say that?

06:55.670 --> 06:59.670
Isn't the point of fighting together
to make up for each other's weaknesses?

07:00.420 --> 07:01.670
Enough goofing off.

07:01.670 --> 07:03.000
Let's go.

07:03.630 --> 07:06.000
Don't get too far from me.
Makes it hard to protect you.

07:08.880 --> 07:09.960
Gramps?

07:09.960 --> 07:13.290
I can't believe the audashity
of that shtupid human!

07:13.290 --> 07:15.210
Chashe after him, Shin human!

07:15.210 --> 07:16.460
Shut it!

07:19.380 --> 07:20.630
Hell...

07:20.630 --> 07:22.540
I need to go through hell.

07:22.540 --> 07:24.630
A plight akin to hell itself.

07:24.630 --> 07:27.710
A hopeless situation like
my future self overcame!

07:28.210 --> 07:30.210
The more I taste it,
the more I adapt to it!

07:30.210 --> 07:34.080
I'll overcome this hell, and then the power
I possess in the future will be mine!

07:35.080 --> 07:36.790
I don't like it one bit.

07:37.290 --> 07:39.670
I don't like his fathomless power

07:39.670 --> 07:41.790
or that he kept it hidden
until the eleventh hour.

07:42.170 --> 07:44.040
But what I dislike most...

07:44.040 --> 07:48.500
is that just a shred of approval from him
hypes me up like a little kid!

07:48.500 --> 07:50.710
This is not growth.

07:50.710 --> 07:55.170
It is as if a mighty warrior's dulled instincts
are being gradually recovered.

07:56.630 --> 08:01.880
As I suspected, this boy's power was refined
over a tremendous period of time!

08:01.880 --> 08:04.080
Watch him! Risk your life for him!

08:04.460 --> 08:07.540
You must learn what you lack from him,
however much that may be!

08:07.540 --> 08:09.790
And you must implement
what you learn at once!

08:17.040 --> 08:20.080
Thinking about it,
Mashter Crimshon only shaid

08:20.080 --> 08:23.000
I should keep my eyesh glued
on the shtupid human.

08:23.380 --> 08:25.830
Sho, ishn't it okay to eat dragonsh?

08:27.290 --> 08:30.790
It's crazy to think we felt so hopeless
just moments ago!

08:31.080 --> 08:33.790
Things are starting to get fun!

08:33.790 --> 08:36.000
Release the mature dragons.

08:37.540 --> 08:39.920
Mature dragon, Temruogtaf.

08:39.920 --> 08:44.000
His predation magic transforms the world
into a supportive environment

08:44.000 --> 08:46.210
so he can devour his chosen prey.

08:46.210 --> 08:50.250
It refracts light and dulls sounds and scents.

08:50.250 --> 08:53.250
It generates force fields in the air nearby
to use as footholds

08:53.250 --> 08:56.500
and creates high mobility by reducing
gravity and air resistance.

08:56.500 --> 08:58.710
It pulls in its prey with gravity.

08:58.710 --> 09:03.170
His magic is unrivaled in speed and efficiency,
making it the ultimate form of predation!

09:05.830 --> 09:07.420
You stupid or something?

09:13.580 --> 09:15.880
That was four. That leaves...

09:15.880 --> 09:18.040
Dude, what the hell!

09:18.040 --> 09:20.670
Why don't you leave some for the rest of us!

09:21.080 --> 09:22.210
Tsk!

09:27.080 --> 09:29.040
But I want to hunt them all.

09:29.580 --> 09:30.750
Let's go.

09:30.750 --> 09:33.000
You don't actually want to fight
as a team, do ya?

09:33.920 --> 09:36.000
After him at onshe, Shin human!

09:36.000 --> 09:37.710
Sh-shut up!

09:38.250 --> 09:40.580
And am I losing it or did you get bigger?

09:40.580 --> 09:43.790
I had a growth shpurt, ash opposhed to you.

09:44.250 --> 09:46.670
I'm gonna chuck you, ya freak of nature!

09:47.790 --> 09:49.420
No, no, no, no, no!

09:49.420 --> 09:50.540
Inconceivable!

09:50.540 --> 09:52.420
It just doesn't make any sense!

09:52.420 --> 09:56.830
I sent six mature dragons and dozens of
inferior and medial dragons into battle,

09:56.830 --> 09:59.040
but they lasted only a minute!

09:59.040 --> 10:01.630
That's fine and dandy. What's not fine...

10:01.630 --> 10:03.750
is how they lost! That's the problem!

10:03.750 --> 10:06.960
He bested Tubby's
predation magic at first sight!

10:06.960 --> 10:09.710
Not even experts can accurately evaluate
magic during an initial encounter!

10:09.710 --> 10:11.460
And yet he...

10:13.500 --> 10:16.080
countered perfectly.

10:16.540 --> 10:18.130
That wasn't just his reflexes.

10:18.130 --> 10:20.130
That was a learned move.

10:20.750 --> 10:22.670
He's not merely strong.

10:22.670 --> 10:25.500
He's... He's...

10:27.880 --> 10:29.500
Those aren't people!

10:29.500 --> 10:31.380
They're traitors who
betrayed us for the dragons!

10:32.040 --> 10:35.250
Fire! Show no mercy!
Killing them is what's right!

10:35.250 --> 10:38.750
Something strange is afoot there too.

10:38.750 --> 10:41.330
Are those civilians?
And what are those guns?

10:41.330 --> 10:42.960
Artifacts from the old era?

10:42.960 --> 10:44.250
Their eyes...

10:44.250 --> 10:46.500
They look as if they've lost their sanity.

10:46.500 --> 10:47.750
Are they brainwashed?

10:47.750 --> 10:49.830
How cruel and unusual.

10:50.080 --> 10:52.790
Retreat above the trees and avoid battle.

10:52.790 --> 10:55.250
This is not the Silverware Princess's
modus operandi.

10:55.250 --> 10:57.420
Someone else is giving orders.

10:57.750 --> 11:01.880
When I heard the details about
the battle in the capital,

11:01.880 --> 11:04.080
I felt revulsion and kinship.

11:04.080 --> 11:06.880
If I were trying to kill Tia,

11:06.880 --> 11:10.580
I'd use the same method.
I'd slaughter citizens in the capital.

11:10.960 --> 11:12.670
The same method...

11:12.670 --> 11:14.630
Brainwashing civilians.

11:15.080 --> 11:16.330
They're here...

11:16.330 --> 11:18.380
on this battlefield.

11:25.540 --> 11:27.420
Y-you...

11:28.630 --> 11:30.000
Master Fu!

11:30.790 --> 11:33.330
I put a lot of thought into it.

11:33.330 --> 11:36.540
And I came to the conclusion that
this is best course of action.

11:36.830 --> 11:40.830
I'll be taking over this magic circle now.

11:50.420 --> 11:52.960
Here's the magic I got from
the Thirteenth Seat.

11:52.960 --> 11:54.080
How's that?

11:54.080 --> 11:55.630
I-it's not enough, sir!

11:55.630 --> 11:58.250
It's still less than forty percent
of the target amount!

11:58.250 --> 12:00.500
This is beyond disastrous, Master Fu!

12:00.500 --> 12:01.710
Put a sock in it!

12:01.710 --> 12:03.170
Piss and moan to the people outside!

12:03.170 --> 12:05.580
I should have suspected
this wouldn't be a picnic.

12:05.960 --> 12:08.330
What is that bozo up to?

12:08.330 --> 12:09.830
So be it.

12:09.830 --> 12:10.830
Go.

12:16.500 --> 12:20.290
I'll be taking over this magic circle now.

12:20.920 --> 12:22.790
But do not fret.

12:22.790 --> 12:26.630
I do not intend to use it in a way
that goes against your wishes.

12:26.630 --> 12:32.170
My aim is merely to escape
the country with everyone.

12:32.170 --> 12:37.630
But I won't be carting around
fifteen hundred civilians of excess baggage.

12:37.630 --> 12:39.080
Piss... off.

12:39.080 --> 12:41.920
Oooh, I understand now, sir!

12:42.540 --> 12:46.000
We totally thought you were gonna ditch us!

12:47.040 --> 12:50.210
I would never discard
such a talented group of people!

12:50.210 --> 12:52.080
Th-th-that's the Master Crish I know!

12:52.080 --> 12:53.880
You have such a discerning eye!

12:53.880 --> 12:56.500
Please don't worry about us civilians!

12:56.500 --> 12:59.790
You guys will be infinitely more
useful to Master Crish!

13:00.540 --> 13:01.710
Master Fu!

13:01.710 --> 13:04.290
Let's do just as Master Crish says!

13:04.290 --> 13:06.290
It's for the sake of Her Highness!

13:06.750 --> 13:08.250
Go to hell!

13:08.630 --> 13:11.290
What exactly did you do to them?

13:11.290 --> 13:12.880
Whatever do you mean?

13:12.880 --> 13:16.500
I only made friends while we
were drawing the circle.

13:16.500 --> 13:20.880
Master Crish, perhaps Master Fu is upset
about getting shot out of nowhere?

13:20.880 --> 13:22.880
Ah, that makes sense!

13:22.880 --> 13:26.880
We were pretty shook up
when you shot his arm!

13:27.710 --> 13:28.880
Sorry about that!

13:28.880 --> 13:31.880
A pitch-black mass of death.

13:33.000 --> 13:35.710
That's word for word
what our commander said.

13:35.710 --> 13:38.500
No way we can let ourselves be duped
by a person like that.

13:38.500 --> 13:39.920
You're wrong.

13:40.580 --> 13:41.670
Is my mind being read?

13:41.670 --> 13:44.790
What are good and evil, Fu?

13:46.170 --> 13:49.000
The Silverware Princess is
a very logical person.

13:49.380 --> 13:51.460
She fully grasped the situation.

13:51.460 --> 13:56.460
She knew no matter what she said,
if she actually discarded all the civilians

13:56.460 --> 14:01.080
and only fled with the corps, the majority
of her troops would not follow her.

14:01.080 --> 14:03.750
Protecting the weak was paramount.

14:04.210 --> 14:07.080
Even if it lowers their chances of survival,
soldiers need a purpose.

14:07.080 --> 14:11.500
And those fifteen hundred people
were their purpose.

14:12.170 --> 14:17.290
But now, since she's retained the majority
of her troops and the battle is raging on,

14:17.290 --> 14:19.710
they no longer serve a purpose.

14:20.080 --> 14:22.880
When you get down to it, they're evil.

14:22.880 --> 14:24.080
Evil?

14:24.380 --> 14:29.040
Evil is sacrificing valuable people
for the sake of useless ones.

14:29.040 --> 14:30.670
In other words, the current situation.

14:30.670 --> 14:32.080
Good is doing the opposite of that.

14:32.380 --> 14:33.540
They...

14:33.540 --> 14:35.460
I want to be useful!

14:36.500 --> 14:40.210
If I kill tons of enemy forces and then die,
Crish will be over the moon!

14:41.670 --> 14:45.250
They understand their existence is evil

14:45.250 --> 14:48.380
and have chosen to sacrifice themselves
for the sake of good.

14:48.630 --> 14:49.830
Isn't that just so noble?

14:49.830 --> 14:51.380
That's so horrendous!

14:51.380 --> 14:52.790
It's brainwashing.

14:53.540 --> 14:56.080
Magical hypnosis, in all likelihood.

14:56.080 --> 14:58.790
But that shouldn't work unless you
catch someone by surprise.

14:59.170 --> 15:01.170
You're a Thaumaturge.

15:01.170 --> 15:04.250
You don't need a purpose
like warriors or soldiers.

15:04.500 --> 15:07.000
I'm sorry for shooting you out of nowhere.

15:07.000 --> 15:09.630
Your fighting capabilities
exceeded my expectations.

15:09.630 --> 15:11.790
I had to just in case.

15:11.790 --> 15:14.710
But I don't plan on injuring you any further.

15:15.250 --> 15:17.880
With the help of the Thaumaturges,

15:17.880 --> 15:22.170
I've already set up other measures
that'll let us teleport only the corps.

15:22.710 --> 15:25.420
Even a third of the magic
we've saved will be enough.

15:25.420 --> 15:27.790
All that's left to do is activate it.

15:27.790 --> 15:29.130
However...

15:29.130 --> 15:33.210
I'm the only person who's able
to activate the circle.

15:33.210 --> 15:35.540
Ultimately, it's up to me.

15:35.540 --> 15:37.630
Yep, exactly.

15:37.630 --> 15:41.080
That's why I especially want to
become friends with you.

15:42.080 --> 15:43.540
They're here.

15:43.540 --> 15:46.290
Whoever is marionetting the civilians

15:46.290 --> 15:48.790
is the same piece of shit
that bombed the capital!

15:48.790 --> 15:50.790
Then what about the Reaper?

15:51.130 --> 15:55.750
The odds that man is him
are high indeed.

16:00.500 --> 16:02.710
Should I call Kamui?

16:03.170 --> 16:04.130
No.

16:04.500 --> 16:07.580
Olto Zora can't call for Kamui.

16:07.580 --> 16:11.000
The Reaper's power
is close to that of Kamui's.

16:11.000 --> 16:14.290
The corps has multiple pawns
that can stop superior dragons.

16:14.290 --> 16:16.500
The moment I summon Kamui,

16:16.500 --> 16:20.670
it's possible Tia could be snatched into
another dimension and murdered.

16:20.960 --> 16:24.290
Sometimes being pitted against
an exceptional enemy is an advantage.

16:24.290 --> 16:28.580
Olto Zora, you never make the wrong call.

16:28.580 --> 16:30.710
And that's exactly why you'll mess up.

16:48.290 --> 16:49.710
Woohoo!

16:49.710 --> 16:52.040
Fantastic! There's so much prey!

16:52.040 --> 16:54.670
If each of us takes down a hundred,
there'd still be some left!

16:54.670 --> 16:57.670
The commander is defending us
from aerial attacks from above!

16:57.670 --> 16:59.250
Our one and only job is simple!

16:59.250 --> 17:03.170
Crush the riffraff on the ground
and keep moving onward!

17:04.750 --> 17:06.580
Let's pulverize 'em!

17:20.580 --> 17:21.670
Greya!

17:23.710 --> 17:24.920
Hesela.

17:40.630 --> 17:42.210
Are there other survivors?

17:42.210 --> 17:43.630
I don't know.

17:44.670 --> 17:46.540
We might be the only ones.

17:46.960 --> 17:48.000
Hesela.

17:48.000 --> 17:49.420
Got it, Greya.

17:50.130 --> 17:51.880
Let's get our revenge.

18:03.710 --> 18:07.290
You think I'm a woman, right?

18:07.290 --> 18:08.540
That's all right.

18:08.540 --> 18:10.960
However you perceive me is correct.

18:10.960 --> 18:12.000
Oh, crap.

18:12.000 --> 18:15.750
Why do you think I assume
such an androgynous appearance?

18:15.750 --> 18:17.960
That's because I want to be
loved by everyone.

18:17.960 --> 18:19.460
Love is good.

18:19.460 --> 18:20.790
I can't move!

18:20.790 --> 18:24.750
People are capable of killing others
for those they love.

18:24.750 --> 18:28.750
People are even capable of sacrificing
themselves for those they love.

18:29.420 --> 18:31.130
It's just incredible!

18:31.130 --> 18:34.830
I want people all over the world to love me!

18:35.290 --> 18:39.040
More than anyone else, I especially want
you to love me, Chief Thaumaturge Fu.

18:39.630 --> 18:46.790
Powerful absorption magic flows
within the blood in your body.

18:46.790 --> 18:48.630
Just like that of a superior dragon's.

18:48.630 --> 18:49.460
That voice is cementing in my mind.
Just like that of a superior dragon's.<b></b>

18:49.460 --> 18:50.710
That voice is cementing in my mind.
I wager you'll become my very special servant.<b></b>

18:50.710 --> 18:53.710
I wager you'll become my very special servant.

18:54.130 --> 18:56.670
Love me, Fu.

18:56.920 --> 19:02.460
I don't love you now, but depending on
what you do, maybe I will one day.

19:02.460 --> 19:04.670
I screwed up.

19:04.670 --> 19:06.290
No matter how dire the situation was,

19:06.290 --> 19:08.210
I shouldn't ever have relied on this maniac!

19:08.580 --> 19:11.790
Now, activate the magic circle for m-

19:11.790 --> 19:13.460
No, don't, Big Brother!

19:13.710 --> 19:15.790
Don't listen to that sleazeball!

19:15.790 --> 19:20.000
We serve Her Highness!
Trust Her Highness!

19:20.000 --> 19:21.540
Hey! Keep it down!

19:21.540 --> 19:23.210
Let go, you oaf!

19:23.210 --> 19:24.380
Big Brother?

19:24.380 --> 19:25.790
You're siblings?

19:25.790 --> 19:27.210
You don't look related.

19:27.210 --> 19:28.960
You... knew...

19:30.540 --> 19:32.420
Oh, sorry.

19:32.420 --> 19:33.750
It was an accident.

19:35.380 --> 19:37.790
Miss... Miss Majo!

19:37.790 --> 19:41.290
Q-quick, we need to prepare a healing circle!

19:41.290 --> 19:42.290
Tsk.

19:47.130 --> 19:49.750
The hypnosis that was taking hold was broken.

19:49.750 --> 19:51.330
What a pain in the ass.

19:51.330 --> 19:53.000
We're teleporting now.

19:53.000 --> 19:56.960
You already sent supplies and people to the
teleportation destination at least, correct?

19:58.040 --> 19:59.920
Damn you!

19:59.920 --> 20:02.170
I'll never be your puppet!

20:03.580 --> 20:05.460
Thaumaturges, stop.

20:06.170 --> 20:09.210
Every ten seconds that elapse,
I will kill one of you.

20:09.210 --> 20:11.580
Starting with the least talented.

20:12.040 --> 20:13.210
You're first.

20:13.710 --> 20:16.210
Activate the circle if you want to
put a stop to this.

20:16.920 --> 20:18.540
Ten, nine, eight, seven...

20:18.540 --> 20:20.080
M-M-M-M-Master Crish?
Ten, nine, eight, seven...<b></b>

20:20.080 --> 20:21.540
Is this some sort of prank?
Ten, nine, eight, seven...<b></b>

20:21.540 --> 20:25.040
We drew the circle together
and were getting along splendidly!

20:25.040 --> 20:27.710
Six, five, four...

20:27.710 --> 20:28.460
Fine! I'll comply!

20:28.460 --> 20:29.500
Three...
Fine! I'll comply!<b></b>

20:29.500 --> 20:31.000
I'll do what you want! Stop!

20:42.960 --> 20:44.380
What in the...?

20:46.290 --> 20:48.920
You know, I...

20:53.380 --> 20:54.330
Shoot!

20:54.330 --> 20:55.290
Shoot her!

21:01.580 --> 21:03.790
I totally hate you!

21:04.210 --> 21:07.960
Get out of here now!

21:20.210 --> 21:22.420
She depleted her magic and passed out.

21:22.420 --> 21:24.420
Master Fu! We're so sorry!

21:24.420 --> 21:26.790
We've opened our eyes and see the truth now!

21:26.790 --> 21:29.210
We'll never trust another hot person again!

21:29.210 --> 21:31.540
Ugh, you pests! Stop touching me!

21:31.540 --> 21:35.630
B-b-b-but Master Fu,
why did Master Crish disappear?

21:36.040 --> 21:39.210
Just as planned, I'm sure.

21:39.880 --> 21:42.630
Must have teleported.
I've got no clue where though.

21:43.920 --> 21:45.040
Huh?

21:45.040 --> 21:45.920
What?

21:45.920 --> 21:47.830
What in the-?

21:48.210 --> 21:49.710
I teleported?

21:49.710 --> 21:51.170
Damn that woman!

21:51.170 --> 21:54.460
Just like how absorption magic
resides within Fu's body,

21:54.460 --> 21:57.170
teleportation magic resides
within her body!

21:57.170 --> 21:58.710
Amazing!

21:58.710 --> 22:01.630
The corps really is teeming with talent!

22:01.630 --> 22:04.210
But I got too greedy!

22:04.920 --> 22:08.830
It wasn't supposed to be like this!

22:25.880 --> 22:32.920
Although I know hiding my true self
beneath my wings is a futile endeavor

22:32.920 --> 22:39.630
Bearing the pain born of loneliness inevitably
gives way to an uneasy future, but also hope

22:39.630 --> 22:43.420
Battles in the sky turn adoration into vapor,
but constantly suppressing desire

22:43.420 --> 22:46.710
Will only ever bear twisted shapes

22:46.710 --> 22:53.670
How selfish of me, to want to make the rays of
the sun as daylight breaks in the east my own

22:53.670 --> 22:57.790
How can I explain that I want to believe

22:57.790 --> 23:06.130
In those dark yet brilliant places,
where vague words can't reach?

23:06.790 --> 23:11.290
Even if the heat burning my body
makes me want to let go

23:11.290 --> 23:15.420
Of the breath caressing my skin

23:15.420 --> 23:22.000
The wings that can carry me back to
that town matter to me a little more

23:22.000 --> 23:29.500
Ahh, if only I could keep going like this forever,
I would find a warm spot

23:29.500 --> 23:34.210
Still too soft to the touch
